Eiji Aonuma Nervoso

Eiji Aonuma recentemente divulgou que estava nervoso para o lançamento do The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time, pois não sabe como vai ficar o jogo.
"I'm all nervous about releasing the remake of 'Ocarina' because I don't know how it's going to turn out, I can't stop thinking about it."
"'I'm very interested to see what the younger staff will imagine' for future titles, he said, adding that he was 'extremely happy' to offer his guidance so they can 'think together' about the next Zelda."
"It's thanks to these young people, by thinking about how to adapt the game in the best possible way, how to make it fun once you have the controls in your hands, that this remake came into being."

